  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 0dd19517-1e7b-47b0-84b4-eaa7b1e74b85
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Holiday seasonality drives peak performance with November 2024 reaching 118,448 units
        • December consistently shows strong sales at 83,829 units in 2024
        • February 2021 had lowest performance at 4,520 units indicating seasonal weakness

        Recommendations:
        • Focus marketing and inventory planning around November-December peak periods
        • Develop strategies to boost February sales given historical low performance
